      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating multiple Python files for different functionalities related to static image and visual understanding using Google Cloud Vision API. The files are categorized into same-scenario scored files, local helper files, and later-step scored files. Each scored file must use a concrete external provider, which in this case is Google Cloud Vision API. The local helper files will contain configuration and utility functions to support the scored files. </thinking>\n\n",
